# suite-content-key copies scripts/, .githooks/ and templates/ whole into a throwaway git repository and keys THAT copy.
# Only the copy is read, never the live repo's history. The key script is REQUIRED and printed where it is located.
# core/fixtures/lib/ is the preamble run.sh sources; the fixture's own directory is copied by the runner without being named.
!scripts/suite-content-key.sh
scripts/
.githooks/
templates/
core/fixtures/lib/
